 "publish_threshold": "not a number. Publication is curate.py's gates (one continuous line, a real name, inside the length band, deduped) plus the NUTS3 quota from pipeline/regions/quotas.py. rate.py scores only what curate.py already chose, so no rating decides publication. The cycling layer does gate on its score (5.4) and on photographs, which is why its listed tier is large.",
